-07-07T19:56:00","session_id":"session_10","session_index":10,"source_sha256":"7018b83cf9905ecedefb62653662afa1824ce7ac2a37bea6161521816ae06827","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":14}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- On 2023-05-01, expressed that it's an amazing feeling when something you create resonates with people, and satisfying to finish something made from scratch — the same joy he finds in seeing a creation come to life [S4T10][S4T12].\n- Has a home music studio where he \"pour[s] [his] heart into the music\"; shared a photo of it (keyboard, synthesizer, and other musical equipment) while telling Dave about the house flood [S6T5].\n- On 2023-05-03, said he's stuck with his music — \"like [his] creativity's frozen\" — and asked Dave for tips; said he'll take Dave's advice (take a break from music and explore other things for fun) to get his \"mojo\" back, and affirmed he won't give up on his music [S5T10][S5T11][S5T12][S5T14].\n- On 2023-05-16, \"super excited\" for the Tokyo performance happening this month (May 2023) — a chance to show his music to a whole new crowd and hopefully expand his following (details in ## Tokyo trip) [S6T11]. The tour went ahead: as of 2023-05-31 he had been touring with Frank Ocean the week before (see ## Tokyo trip) [S7T1].\n- As of 2023-06-09, has an album in progress (\"my album\"); met with the creative team for it on 2023-06-08 — \"a long session, but awesome to see everything coming together\", and he's \"feeling stoked\" and \"making some magic\" in the studio working on the music and everything. He shared a photo of the studio (a recording studio with a large window and a desk) [S8T1][S8T3].\n- On 2023-05-31, said performing live \"always fuels my soul\" — he loves \"the rush and connection with the crowd,\" \"the feeling's indescribable — it's an absolute high\"; at a concert \"Everyone is part of it, it's like one big harmony.\" The chat came with concert photos (a large crowd taking pictures of a concert; a crowd watching a concert with bright lights; a band performing on stage) [S7T10][S7T11][S7T12][S7T13][S7T14].\n- As of 2023-07-07, is working on music collaborations with Japanese artists and promised Dave he'll share clips when everything's ready (details in ## Japan plan) [S10T12][S10T14].","text_sha256":"fe05cd78f3a28f12f12986db8fc04e6bdd664f95d796962ec8448cef5ec1ad15","timestamp":null}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","pre_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":515,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":49985,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":50500},"model":{"requested_model":"x-test-2","served_models":["deepseek-v4.1-flash"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"60d0c608bdda6e13c46a9e6cbf4cd7cae4f7eea8d7fcd2d8a4f8f9bde415df7c","filesystem_tools_sha256":"1632a476feccd761a1c6d21c9d2962d0975632f50d6c96678d69427a7f973ed7","orchestration_actions_sha256":"115512fb955e8c7fca557e4b995c5bfd8717ca72dfb184810b04343bc595cd08","paper_prompt_id":"refind-stage1-plus-r3-curated-adapter-v1","paper_prompt_sha256":"20422063cc471ee1de75c38e4250e1a141a731ea2970786a6c715dc3c83cf7de"},"protocol_version":"shared-evidence-bundle-v1","question":{"conversation_id":"conv-50","question":"How does Calvin plan to jumpstart his inspiration?","question_id":"conv-50-q081","question_set_id":"locomo-conv50-main40-v1","run_position":2,"schema_version":1},"question_sha256":"009fe8927eeabce19a03bedd03bdf2eb41cfd16aaae2d261307ba94125d5d632","runtime_contract":{"evidence_budget_limit":16000,"evidence_budget_unit":"characters","round_limit":4,"runtime_sha256":"249a6b257f0f99d1644dabf7db84665df46f6bccbc9dafc06d576a7cb7f174e2"},"schema_v